# Editor swap/backup files — vim swap headers embed the username, hostname,
# and absolute path of the machine that wrote them. Never commit them.
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
.*.sw[a-p]
*~
*.bak
.#*
\#*#

# OS metadata
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Scanner working artifacts (when this repo is itself a scan target)
.llm-sast-scanner-cache/
sast_report-*.md

# Working plans and scan notes: these reference the target codebase under
# audit by name, path, and finding. Local working state, never published.
docs/superpowers/
